[l_braz_por.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Blindagem

[l_braz_por.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
Melhor blindagem para proteger seu navio contra fogo inimigo

[l_braz_por.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_braz_por.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
Um navio com um motor mais poderoso pode controlar a distância dos oponentes em batalha

[l_braz_por.ship_ASW_upgrade]
ASW

[l_braz_por.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
Armas de guerra anti-submarina são importante na localização e eliminação de submarinos.

[l_braz_por.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
Antiaéreo

[l_braz_por.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
Mais armas disparando no ar significa mais aviões inimigos abatidos

[l_braz_por.ship_armor_upgrade]
Blindagem

[l_braz_por.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
Mais blindagem para proteger seu navio contra fogo inimigo

[l_braz_por.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Espaço do convés

[l_braz_por.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
Mais espaço para carregar e lançar aviões embarcados

[l_braz_por.ship_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_braz_por.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
Um navio com um motor mais poderoso, capaz de ditar a distância dos oponentes em batalha.

[l_braz_por.ship_gun_upgrade]
Arma

[l_braz_por.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
É importante ter uma arma que acompanhe a força da blindagem inimiga e que possa penetrá-la.

[l_braz_por.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Confiabilidade

[l_braz_por.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
Um navio com alta confiabilidade é menos propenso a golpes críticos, que pode causar dano maciço a um navio com a construção não muito bem planejada.

[l_braz_por.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_braz_por.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Um torpedo é um ataque poderoso lançado por navios menores, uma vez que com alcance há uma chance alta de golpes críticos

[l_braz_por.sub_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_braz_por.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
Um navio com um motor mais poderoso, capaz de ditar a distância dos oponentes em batalha.

[l_braz_por.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Furtividade

[l_braz_por.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
A maior força de um submarino é sua habilidade de permanecer indetectável e atacar apenas quando tiver vantagem.

[l_braz_por.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_braz_por.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Um torpedo é um ataque poderoso lançado por navios menores, uma vez que com alcance há uma chance alta de golpes críticos

[l_english.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Armor

[l_english.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
More armor to protect your ship against enemy fire

[l_english.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Engine

[l_english.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
A ship with a more powerful engine can control distance to its opponents in battle

[l_english.ship_ASW_upgrade]
ASW

[l_english.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
Anti-Submarine-Warfare weapons are important for locating and taking out submarines.

[l_english.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
Anti-Air

[l_english.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
More guns putting lead in the air means more enemy planes shot down!

[l_english.ship_armor_upgrade]
Armor

[l_english.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
More armor to protect your ship against enemy fire

[l_english.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Deck space

[l_english.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
More room to carry and launch carrier-capable airplanes

[l_english.ship_engine_upgrade]
Engine

[l_english.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
A ship with a more powerful engine can control distance to its opponents in battle

[l_english.ship_gun_upgrade]
Gun

[l_english.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
It's important to have a gun that keep up with enemy armor strength and can penetrate.

[l_english.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Reliability

[l_english.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
A ship with high reliability will be less prone to critical hits that can do massive damage to a ship without well thought out construction.

[l_english.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_english.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
A torpedo is a powerful attack launchable by smaller ships once in range with a high chance of critical hits

[l_english.sub_engine_upgrade]
Engine

[l_english.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
A ship with a more powerful engine can control distance to its opponents in battle

[l_english.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Stealth

[l_english.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
A submarines greatest strength is its ability to remain undetected and only strike when it has the advantage.

[l_english.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_english.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
A torpedo is a powerful attack launchable by smaller ships once in range with a high chance of critical hits

[l_french.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Blindage

[l_french.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
Blindage renforcé pour protéger votre navire des tirs ennemis.

[l_french.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Moteur

[l_french.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
Le navire doté de la motorisation la plus puissante décide de la distance d'avec l'ennemi au cours des combats.

[l_french.ship_ASW_upgrade]
ASM

[l_french.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
Les armes de lutte anti-sous-marine permettent de détecter et détruire les sous-marins ennemis.

[l_french.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
Canons anti-aériens

[l_french.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
Plus vous aurez de canons anti-aériens, plus vous descendrez d'avions ennemis !

[l_french.ship_armor_upgrade]
Blindage

[l_french.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
Un blindage renforcé permet de mieux protéger le navire des tirs ennemis.

[l_french.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Pont d'envol

[l_french.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
Espace accru pour transporter et catapulter des avions.

[l_french.ship_engine_upgrade]
Moteur

[l_french.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
Un navire doté d'un puissant moteur peut tenir ses adversaires à distance lors des combats.

[l_french.ship_gun_upgrade]
Canons

[l_french.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
Il est crucial de doter les navires de canons adaptés au blindage ennemi afin de le percer.

[l_french.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Fiabilité

[l_french.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
Un navire très fiable échappera plus facilement aux frappes critiques qui peuvent sérieusement endommager un bâtiment mal conçu.

[l_french.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpilles

[l_french.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
La torpille constitue une arme offensive d'une puissance telle qu'elle permet aux plus petits navires, une fois à portée, d'infliger des dégâts critiques aux navires ennemis.

[l_french.sub_engine_upgrade]
Moteur

[l_french.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
Le navire doté de la motorisation la plus puissante décide de la distance d'avec l'ennemi au cours des combats.

[l_french.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Furtivité

[l_french.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
La plus grande force d'un sous-marin est sa capacité à rester indétectable et à ne frapper que lorsqu'il a l'avantage.

[l_french.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpilles

[l_french.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
La torpille constitue une arme offensive d'une puissance telle qu'elle permet aux plus petits navires, une fois à portée, d'infliger des dégâts critiques aux navires ennemis.

[l_german.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Panzerung

[l_german.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
Mehr Panzerung, um Ihr Schiff gegen Feindbeschuss zu schützen.

[l_german.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_german.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
Ein Schiff mit stärkerem Antrieb kann im Gefecht die Entfernung zum Gegner zu seinem Vorteil nutzen.

[l_german.ship_ASW_upgrade]
Sonar

[l_german.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
Waffen zur U-Boot-Bekämpfung sind wichtig zum Aufspüren und Versenken von U-Booten.

[l_german.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
Flak

[l_german.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
Wenn mehr Kanonen ihr Blei in den Himmel spucken, gehen mehr Feindflugzeuge zu Boden!

[l_german.ship_armor_upgrade]
Panzerung

[l_german.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
Mehr Panzerung, um Ihr Schiff gegen Feindbeschuss zu schützen.

[l_german.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Deckfläche

[l_german.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
Mehr Platz zum Transport und Start von Trägerflugzeugen.

[l_german.ship_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_german.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
Ein Schiff mit stärkerem Antrieb kann im Gefecht die Entfernung zum Gegner zu seinem Vorteil nutzen.

[l_german.ship_gun_upgrade]
Geschütz

[l_german.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
Ein Hauptgeschütz, das die feindliche Panzerung durchdringen kann, ist sehr wichtig.

[l_german.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Zuverlässigkeit

[l_german.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
Ein Schiff mit hoher Zuverlässigkeit muss mit geringerer Wahrscheinlichkeit kritische Treffer hinnehmen, die Schiffe mit weniger gut durchdachtem Bau massiv beschädigen können.

[l_german.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_german.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Mit Torpedos können kleinere Schiffe mit großer Wahrscheinlichkeit kritische Treffer erzielen.

[l_german.sub_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_german.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
Ein Schiff mit stärkerem Antrieb kann im Gefecht die Entfernung zum Gegner zu seinem Vorteil nutzen.

[l_german.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Tarnung

[l_german.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
Die größte Stärke eines U-Boots ist seine Fähigkeit, im Verborgenen zu bleiben und erst dann zuzuschlagen, wenn es im Vorteil ist.

[l_german.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_german.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Mit Torpedos können kleinere Schiffe mit großer Wahrscheinlichkeit kritische Treffer erzielen.

[l_japanese.carrier_armor_upgrade]
装甲

[l_japanese.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
追加装甲は敵の砲火から自艦船を保護する。

[l_japanese.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
機関

[l_japanese.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
より強力な機関を搭載した艦船は、戦闘において敵との距離を思い通りに保持する事ができる。

[l_japanese.ship_ASW_upgrade]
対潜兵装

[l_japanese.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
対潜兵装は、潜水艦の発見と捕捉に重要なものである。

[l_japanese.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
対空砲

[l_japanese.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
より多くの対空兵装を搭載する事は、より多くの敵機を撃墜できる事を意味する！

[l_japanese.ship_armor_upgrade]
装甲

[l_japanese.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
追加装甲は敵の砲火から自艦船を保護する。

[l_japanese.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
飛行甲板スペース

[l_japanese.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
艦載機を搭載し発艦させる為により広い空間を確保する。

[l_japanese.ship_engine_upgrade]
機関

[l_japanese.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
より強力な機関を搭載した艦船は、戦闘において敵との距離を思い通りに保持する事ができる。

[l_japanese.ship_gun_upgrade]
艦砲

[l_japanese.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
敵の装甲を撃ち破ることのできる砲を保持し続けることが重要だ。

[l_japanese.ship_reliability_upgrade]
信頼性

[l_japanese.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
高い信頼性を持つ艦船は、粗雑な構造の艦船であれば大破するような攻撃を受けても、致命的な打撃になりにくい。

[l_japanese.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
魚雷

[l_japanese.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
魚雷は小さな艦船からでも、一旦射程に入れば高確率で致命的な打撃を与える事ができる強力な兵器である。

[l_japanese.sub_engine_upgrade]
機関

[l_japanese.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
より強力な機関を搭載した艦船は、戦闘において敵との距離を思い通りに保持する事ができる。

[l_japanese.sub_stealth_upgrade]
ステルス

[l_japanese.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
潜水艦の最大の強みは、簡単には発見されず、そのままその有利な状況から攻撃できることだ。

[l_japanese.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
魚雷

[l_japanese.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
魚雷は小さな艦船から射程内の敵艦船に、致命的な一撃を高い確率で与える事ができる強力な兵器である。

[l_korean.carrier_armor_upgrade]
장갑

[l_korean.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
적의 포격으로부터 함선을 보호하기 위해 장갑을 추가합니다.

[l_korean.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
엔진

[l_korean.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
더 강력한 엔진을 단 함선은 전투에서 적과의 거리를 원하는 대로 조절할 수 있습니다.

[l_korean.ship_ASW_upgrade]
대잠전

[l_korean.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
대잠수함전 무기는 잠수함을 탐지하고 격파하는 데 중요합니다.

[l_korean.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
대공포

[l_korean.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
더 많은 총으로 하늘에 총알을 뿌리면 더 많은 적 비행기를 격추할 수 있습니다!

[l_korean.ship_armor_upgrade]
장갑

[l_korean.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
적의 포격으로부터 함선을 보호하기 위해 장갑을 추가합니다.

[l_korean.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
갑판 공간

[l_korean.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
함재기들을 격납하고 출격시키기 위한 추가 공간입니다.

[l_korean.ship_engine_upgrade]
엔진

[l_korean.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
더 강력한 엔진을 단 함선은 전투에서 적과의 거리를 원하는 대로 조절할 수 있습니다.

[l_korean.ship_gun_upgrade]
함포

[l_korean.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
기술 발전으로 점점 단단해지는 적의 장갑을 변함없이 관통할 수 있는 포를 갖추는 게 중요합니다.

[l_korean.ship_reliability_upgrade]
신뢰도

[l_korean.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
신뢰도가 높은 함선은 대충 건조된 함선에 엄청난 피해를 주는 결정적인 타격에 덜 취약해집니다.

[l_korean.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
어뢰

[l_korean.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
어뢰는 작은 함선이 일정 거리 내에 접근했을 때 발사할 수 있는 강력한 공격 무기로, 치명적인 피해를 입힐 확률이 높습니다.

[l_korean.sub_engine_upgrade]
엔진

[l_korean.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
더 강력한 엔진을 단 함선은 전투에서 적과의 거리를 원하는 대로 조절할 수 있습니다.

[l_korean.sub_stealth_upgrade]
잠항

[l_korean.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
잠수함의 가장 큰 강점은 탐지되지 않은 상태로 있다가 유리한 상황에서만 공격하는 능력입니다.

[l_korean.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
어뢰

[l_korean.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
어뢰는 작은 함선이 일정 거리 내에 접근했을 때 발사할 수 있는 강력한 공격 무기로, 치명적인 피해를 입힐 확률이 높습니다.

[l_polish.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Pancerz

[l_polish.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
Cięższy pancerz chroniący okręt przed ogniem nieprzyjaciela

[l_polish.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Silnik

[l_polish.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
Potężne silniki okrętów pozwalają lepiej kontrolować dystans, na jakim prowadzona jest walka.

[l_polish.ship_ASW_upgrade]
ZOP

[l_polish.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
Broń do zwalczania okrętów podwodnych jest bardzo przydatna w starciach z jednostkami tego typu.

[l_polish.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
Plot.

[l_polish.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
Więcej luf prujących w niebo ołowiem oznacza większą liczbę zestrzelonych samolotów!

[l_polish.ship_armor_upgrade]
Pancerz

[l_polish.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
Cięższy pancerz chroniący okręt przed ogniem nieprzyjaciela.

[l_polish.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Pokład startowy

[l_polish.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
Większa ilość miejsca dla maszyn lotnictwa morskiego.

[l_polish.ship_engine_upgrade]
Silnik

[l_polish.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
Potężne silniki pozwalają lepiej kontrolować dystans, na jakim prowadzona jest walka.

[l_polish.ship_gun_upgrade]
Działo

[l_polish.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
Działa muszą być modernizowane, by mogły przebijać pancerz nowych maszyn wroga.

[l_polish.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Niezawodność

[l_polish.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
Niezawodne okręty są mniej podatne na uszkodzenia krytyczne, które mogą zdruzgotać gorzej zaprojektowane jednostki.

[l_polish.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpeda

[l_polish.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Torpedy umożliwiają małym okrętom wykonywanie potężnych ataków mających duże szanse na spowodowanie krytycznych uszkodzeń.

[l_polish.sub_engine_upgrade]
Silnik

[l_polish.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
Potężne silniki pozwalają lepiej kontrolować dystans, na jakim prowadzona jest walka.

[l_polish.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Niewykrywalność

[l_polish.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
Siła okrętów podwodnych opiera się na tym, że mogą pozostać niezauważone przez wroga, by uderzyć w dogodnym momencie.

[l_polish.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpeda

[l_polish.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Torpedy umożliwiają małym okrętom wykonywanie potężnych ataków mających duże szanse na spowodowanie krytycznych uszkodzeń.

[l_russian.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Броня

[l_russian.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
Более прочная броня, чтобы защитить корабль от вражеского огня.

[l_russian.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Двигатель

[l_russian.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
Корабль с более мощным двигателем может контролировать дистанцию до противника

[l_russian.ship_ASW_upgrade]
ПЛО

[l_russian.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
Противолодочное вооружение позволяет обнаруживать и нейтрализовывать субмарины противника.

[l_russian.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
ПВО

[l_russian.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
Больше пушек, направленных в воздух, — больше сбитых самолетов!

[l_russian.ship_armor_upgrade]
Броня

[l_russian.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
Более прочная броня, чтобы защитить корабль от вражеского огня.

[l_russian.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Палуба

[l_russian.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
Больше места для размещения и запуска палубной авиации.

[l_russian.ship_engine_upgrade]
Двигатель

[l_russian.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
Корабль с более мощным двигателем может контролировать дистанцию до противника.

[l_russian.ship_gun_upgrade]
Орудия

[l_russian.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
Важно иметь орудие, которому по зубам броня противника.

[l_russian.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Надежность

[l_russian.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
Надежный корабль реже получает критические попадания, которые способны нанести колоссальный урон, если в конструкции есть уязвимые места.

[l_russian.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Торпеды

[l_russian.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Торпеда — мощное оружие, доступное даже малым судам. Имеет высокий шанс нанести критический урон.

[l_russian.sub_engine_upgrade]
Двигатель

[l_russian.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
Корабль с более мощным двигателем может контролировать дистанцию до противника.

[l_russian.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Незаметность

[l_russian.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
Самое главное преимущество подводной лодки — способность оставаться вне поля зрения и наносить удар, когда наступает подходящий момент.

[l_russian.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Торпеды

[l_russian.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Торпеда — мощное оружие, доступное даже малым судам. Имеет высокий шанс нанести критический урон.

[l_simp_chinese.carrier_armor_upgrade]
装甲厚度

[l_simp_chinese.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
更厚的装甲以保护你的船只免于敌马炮火

[l_simp_chinese.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
引擎

[l_simp_chinese.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
具有更强大引擎的船只可以在战斗中更好地控制其余敌马的距离

[l_simp_chinese.ship_ASW_upgrade]
反潜武器

[l_simp_chinese.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
反潜武器对于定位和摆脱潜艇非常重要。

[l_simp_chinese.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
防空

[l_simp_chinese.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
装备更多的火炮意味着我们将击落更多的敌机！

[l_simp_chinese.ship_armor_upgrade]
装甲厚度

[l_simp_chinese.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
更厚的装甲以保护你的船只免于敌马炮火

[l_simp_chinese.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
甲板空间

[l_simp_chinese.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
更大的空间用以携带和发射舰载机。

[l_simp_chinese.ship_engine_upgrade]
引擎

[l_simp_chinese.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
具有更强大引擎的船只可以在战斗中更好地控制其与敌马的距离

[l_simp_chinese.ship_gun_upgrade]
舰炮

[l_simp_chinese.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
装备穿甲厚度超过敌马装甲的主炮是非常重要的。

[l_simp_chinese.ship_reliability_upgrade]
可靠性

[l_simp_chinese.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
具有更高可靠性的船只不会轻易被致命一击击沉，那些会被致命一击的船只明显没有经过深思熟虑的设计与建设。

[l_simp_chinese.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
鱼雷

[l_simp_chinese.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
鱼雷是一种强大的攻击武器，由较小船只在射程内发射，具有很大机会打出致命一击

[l_simp_chinese.sub_engine_upgrade]
引擎

[l_simp_chinese.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
具有更强大引擎的船只可以在战斗中更好地控制其余敌马的距离

[l_simp_chinese.sub_stealth_upgrade]
潜伏性

[l_simp_chinese.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
潜艇最强大之处在于直到他在形势有利时打出致命一击前都不被察觉到。

[l_simp_chinese.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
鱼雷

[l_simp_chinese.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
鱼雷是一种强大的攻击武器，由较小船只在射程内发射，具有很大机会打出致命一击

[l_spanish.carrier_armor_upgrade]
Blindaje

[l_spanish.carrier_armor_upgrade_desc]
Más blindaje para proteger tu buque contra el fuego enemigo

[l_spanish.destroyer_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_spanish.destroyer_engine_upgrade_desc]
Un barco con un motor más potente puede controlar la distancia hasta sus adversarios en combate.

[l_spanish.ship_ASW_upgrade]
ASB

[l_spanish.ship_ASW_upgrade_desc]
El armamento antisubmarino es importante para localizar y eliminar submarinos.

[l_spanish.ship_anti_air_upgrade]
Antiaéreo

[l_spanish.ship_anti_air_upgrade_desc]
¡Más cañones disparando plomo al aire, más aviones enemigos derribados!

[l_spanish.ship_armor_upgrade]
Blindaje

[l_spanish.ship_armor_upgrade_desc]
Más blindaje para proteger el barco contra fuego enemigo.

[l_spanish.ship_deckspace_upgrade]
Espacio de cubierta

[l_spanish.ship_deckspace_upgrade_desc]
Más espacio para llevar y lanzar aviones capaces de operar en portaaviones.

[l_spanish.ship_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_spanish.ship_engine_upgrade_desc]
Un barco con un motor más potente puede controlar su distancia con el enemigo durante el combate.

[l_spanish.ship_gun_upgrade]
Arma

[l_spanish.ship_gun_upgrade_desc]
Es importante tener un cañón que se mantenga al día del blindaje enemigo y pueda perforarlo.

[l_spanish.ship_reliability_upgrade]
Fiabilidad

[l_spanish.ship_reliability_upgrade_desc]
Un barco con alta fiabilidad será menos dado a impactos críticos que pueden causar daños masivos a barcos sin una construcción bien planeada.

[l_spanish.ship_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_spanish.ship_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Un torpedo es una poderosa arma de lanzamiento de barcos pequeños una vez al alcance, con una gran posibilidad de impactos críticos.

[l_spanish.sub_engine_upgrade]
Motor

[l_spanish.sub_engine_upgrade_desc]
Un barco con un motor más potente puede controlar su distancia con el enemigo durante el combate.

[l_spanish.sub_stealth_upgrade]
Sigilo

[l_spanish.sub_stealth_upgrade_desc]
La mayor fortaleza del submarino es su habilidad no ser detectado y atacar solo cuando tiene ventaja.

[l_spanish.sub_torpedo_upgrade]
Torpedo

[l_spanish.sub_torpedo_upgrade_desc]
Un torpedo es una poderosa arma de lanzamiento de barcos pequeños una vez al alcance, con una gran posibilidad de impactos críticos.
